{
  "_comment": "PR smoke selection config for build-ci-matrix.js --select-for-changes. global_paths force the FULL matrix on the PR (shared frontend code, deps, and the smoke machinery itself); ignore_paths are files that cannot affect the app; a changed file matching neither list nor any shard's globs (its folder_paths entry, keyed by actual_folder, plus optional per-shard paths extras; a shard also implicitly owns its own playwright-tests folder) pulls in core_shards \u2014 one representative shard per major surface \u2014 because merge_group always runs the full matrix before anything lands. always_run shards are appended to every smoke selection as a cheap canary. Selection never emits zero shards.",
  "always_ignore_paths": [
    "web/src/**/*.spec.ts",
    "web/src/**/*.spec.js",
    "web/src/**/*.test.ts",
    "web/src/**/__snapshots__/**",
    "web/src/test/**"
  ],
